    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n4 Bed Detached Bungalow.\n\nDNG Doyle are delighted to present Teach Seán Thomáis, ideally located within easy walking distance of Newbridge Town Centre.Originally a 4 bed detached family home, located in a private cul de sac only minutes from Newbridge town centre and a host of amenities to include Whitewater Shopping Centre, Schools, and Newbridge Train Station. This property has been converted into two self-contained flats.Flat 1 comprises an entrance hall, living room, kitchen dining room, two bedrooms and a bathroom.Flat 2 consists of a kitchen dining room and one bedroom with an ensuite.Set in a highly convenient location offering a private setting with ample parking ideal investment property or could easily be converted back to a family home. Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nFLAT 1 : - \n\n\n- - \n\n\nEntrance Hall : - \nWood flooring, hot press with storage\n\n- - \n\n\nLiving Room : - 5.467m x 4.268m\nLarge bay window, dual aspect, wood flooring and red brick fireplace with slate hearth.\n\n- - \n\n\nKitchen Dining Room : - 5.740m x 3.277m\nFitted kitchen with ample units, tiled splash back, stainless steel sink unit, tiled floor, pumbed for washing machine, door access to side.\n\n- - \n\n\nBedroom 1 : - 3.287m x 2.986m\nDouble to side, wood flooring.\n\n- - \n\n\nBedroom 2 : - 3.232m x 3.294m\nDouble to side, wood flooring.\n\n- - \n\n\nBathroom : - \nTiled shower, w.c., w.h.b., electric shower and razor light.\n\n- - \n\n\nFLAT 2 : - \n\n\n- - \n\n\nKitchen Dining Room : - 3.280m x 4.175m\nFitted kitchn with ample units, tiled splash back, stainless steel sink unit, tiled floor, pumbed for washing machine, sliding door to rear.\n\n- - \n\n\nBedroom 1 : - 4.397m x 3.525m\nDouble to rear, electric storage heater.\n\n- - \n\n\nEnsuite Bathroom : - \nTiled shower with w.c., w.h.b., and tiled floor.\n\n- - \n\n\nOutside : - \n\n\n- - \n\n\nDisclaimer : - \nThe above are issued by DNG Doyle Naas on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars which are issued for guidance purposes only and neither the form nor the agent holds themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. The purchaser is advised to make their own arrangements to satisfy themselves with measurements, details and contents include conditions.\n\n"
      },
